  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 7302.03 Exceptional disaster relief loan",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 7302.03 “Exceptional disaster relief loan” means “exceptional disaster relief loan” as defined in RSA 21-P:37-c, I, namely, a temporary loan from the state treasury to assist communities experiencing exceptional costs due to natural disasters.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 5900) #13168, 2-19-21",
